{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_01:1_5_043_01:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_01:1_5_043_01:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_01:1_5_043_01:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_01:1_5_043_01:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b88e4d764da9220f8836556a10b5a269bcbc742c82885fffd81d9f0c2ecc60bf",
      "text": "迷你旅游节目旁白解说的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_01:1_5_043_01:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:849b012990a7d1bc62fd3f9284aecc21e6ab692941a5885405a2d4528a11cd1e",
      "text": "…刚才在旁白里介绍过的地方。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_01:1_5_043_01:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6321ef0abcca20ef8f0f520d65f88aba2fcbbf7068d0e33e0a290e3594103a9b",
      "text": "是的。有什么让您在意的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_01:1_5_043_01:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5923cf4b148eb6091e3a775bb8fd612b36e5af15afe40fe1222e9e76e6f9ff54",
      "text": "…是我一直想着有朝一日想去看看的地方。\n所以拿到节目详情时吓了一跳。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_01:1_5_043_01:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd340c4dbb355eef6881d87b41470c0f2e10d8ae4802b52905de259cf300a570",
      "text": "碰头会时您那么惊讶，\n原来是因为这个啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_01:1_5_043_01:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24a520bbc8cf6d066029f5b83649c73068132d52aa60052a0cb8b0814158bc88",
      "text": "…嗯。之前查阅世界各地的森林时\n发现的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_01:1_5_043_01:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:744a048db6b565df5723d00020ad1422732e02a5b357a01279c15bf6b743c020",
      "text": "…广阔的森林里生长着许多珍稀植物，\n似乎能在里面徒步走上一整天呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_01:1_5_043_01:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf68fb2851ea91fd5fe18c5b3e1effd1be77d379c2de317939d40f95e91a4817",
      "text": "…一边听着林间的飒飒风声一边看书，\n感觉也很不错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_01:1_5_043_01:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b57822d0670ecfe7dd07383901ea9ecb6c05693e733b5ecb8089411cf50c6ab1",
      "text": "在森林里看书啊。\n一希先生会带什么样的书去呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_01:1_5_043_01:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99780f2449b5952f53ef018b36cba361111e4da18e812993657bd2274fcdba0e",
      "text": "…也是呢。有关森林的书至少会带上一本。\n剩下的想到了就都带上。还有就是，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_01:1_5_043_01:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed6fef9e0661c6957bfd18dcaf07828f6fb1ee5edaea1afc31b3ff007668b6ca",
      "text": "…制作人要是有推荐的书，\n请告诉我。我无论如何都想在那片森林里读读看。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
